Swim4Track research software

The supplied reef_bluerov2_baseline implementation declares Apache-2.0 in
its package.xml and setup.py. This repository preserves that code-license
declaration; the standard license text is provided in LICENSE. No new
copyright owner or third-party permission is asserted by this notice.

The implementation follows standard marine-craft dynamics and builds on
the REEF/Swim4Real baseline formulation, Stable-Baselines3, SB3-Contrib TQC,
Gymnasium, NumPy and SciPy. ROS 2 and Stonefish provide the separate
deployment environment. These projects retain their own licenses and
attribution requirements. They are not relicensed by this repository.

The code-license declaration does not establish redistribution terms for
model weights, figures, video, simulator meshes or external assets.
See models/README.md and docs/ASSET_PROVENANCE.md. Complete the release
checklist before public distribution.
